{
  "success": true,
  "credits_remaining": 22163,
  "credits_charged": 1,
  "type": "video",
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5DCevq7fbtQ",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you very much. Thank you,",
      "startMs": "1600",
      "endMs": "4640",
      "startTimeText": "0:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "President Crow,",
      "startMs": "2760",
      "endMs": "7560",
      "startTimeText": "0:02"
    },
    {
      "text": "for the kind, gracious, um,",
      "startMs": "4640",
      "endMs": "9200",
      "startTimeText": "0:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "introduction.",
      "startMs": "7560",
      "endMs": "11840",
      "startTimeText": "0:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "And for the privilege to address all of",
      "startMs": "9200",
      "endMs": "15040",
      "startTimeText": "0:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "you here today.",
      "startMs": "11840",
      "endMs": "17280",
      "startTimeText": "0:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "You're here because you have",
      "startMs": "15040",
      "endMs": "19560",
      "startTimeText": "0:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "accomplished something",
      "startMs": "17280",
      "endMs": "21840",
      "startTimeText": "0:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "significant.",
      "startMs": "19560",
      "endMs": "24040",
      "startTimeText": "0:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "You understood the opportunity before",
      "startMs": "21840",
      "endMs": "25080",
      "startTimeText": "0:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "you.",
      "startMs": "24040",
      "endMs": "26920",
      "startTimeText": "0:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "You took advantage of all this",
      "startMs": "25080",
      "endMs": "30440",
      "startTimeText": "0:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "world-class university had to offer.",
      "startMs": "26920",
      "endMs": "33200",
      "startTimeText": "0:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "You made wise choices,",
      "startMs": "30440",
      "endMs": "35440",
      "startTimeText": "0:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "followed through with the work.",
      "startMs": "33200",
      "endMs": "38840",
      "startTimeText": "0:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "I celebrate your commitment.",
      "startMs": "35440",
      "endMs": "41960",
      "startTimeText": "0:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "The combined success of all of you,",
      "startMs": "38840",
      "endMs": "46680",
      "startTimeText": "0:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "the potential of your entire generation,",
      "startMs": "41960",
      "endMs": "49040",
      "startTimeText": "0:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "that is what gives me hope for the",
      "startMs": "46680",
      "endMs": "50435",
      "startTimeText": "0:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "future.",
      "startMs": "49040",
      "endMs": "51240",
      "startTimeText": "0:49"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [snorts]",
      "startMs": "50435",
      "endMs": "53160",
      "startTimeText": "0:50"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I didn't give much thought to the",
      "startMs": "51240",
      "endMs": "55400",
      "startTimeText": "0:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "future, to my future,",
      "startMs": "53160",
      "endMs": "57680",
      "startTimeText": "0:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "when I was in college.",
      "startMs": "55400",
      "endMs": "61400",
      "startTimeText": "0:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "I did not make good choices.",
      "startMs": "57680",
      "endMs": "63960",
      "startTimeText": "0:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't have the perspective,",
      "startMs": "61400",
      "endMs": "66120",
      "startTimeText": "1:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "the maturity.",
      "startMs": "63960",
      "endMs": "69600",
      "startTimeText": "1:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "I served only myself.",
      "startMs": "66120",
      "endMs": "73040",
      "startTimeText": "1:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "I was squandering my life in riotous",
      "startMs": "69600",
      "endMs": "75040",
      "startTimeText": "1:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "living.",
      "startMs": "73040",
      "endMs": "77480",
      "startTimeText": "1:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "By my junior year, I was in real",
      "startMs": "75040",
      "endMs": "80640",
      "startTimeText": "1:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "trouble, grade point wise,",
      "startMs": "77480",
      "endMs": "83920",
      "startTimeText": "1:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "and looking for an easy A.",
      "startMs": "80640",
      "endMs": "86120",
      "startTimeText": "1:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "I took a course the catalog called",
      "startMs": "83920",
      "endMs": "89280",
      "startTimeText": "1:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "drama, the study of plays.",
      "startMs": "86120",
      "endMs": "91640",
      "startTimeText": "1:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "We'd be responsible for putting on plays",
      "startMs": "89280",
      "endMs": "93240",
      "startTimeText": "1:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "for the college,",
      "startMs": "91640",
      "endMs": "94520",
      "startTimeText": "1:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "but I didn't give that part much",
      "startMs": "93240",
      "endMs": "96720",
      "startTimeText": "1:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "thought. I thought I'd work in the box",
      "startMs": "94520",
      "endMs": "99920",
      "startTimeText": "1:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "office or build sets.",
      "startMs": "96720",
      "endMs": "102760",
      "startTimeText": "1:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "My classmates My classmates were people",
      "startMs": "99920",
      "endMs": "107040",
      "startTimeText": "1:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "I had previously discounted as",
      "startMs": "102760",
      "endMs": "110240",
      "startTimeText": "1:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "geeks and misfits.",
      "startMs": "107040",
      "endMs": "113880",
      "startTimeText": "1:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "But I soon realized",
      "startMs": "110240",
      "endMs": "117901",
      "startTimeText": "1:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "I was a geek and a misfit.",
      "startMs": "113880",
      "endMs": "119921",
      "startTimeText": "1:53"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "117901",
      "endMs": "119921",
      "startTimeText": "1:57"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I had found my fit.",
      "startMs": "122320",
      "endMs": "128080",
      "startTimeText": "2:02"
    },
    {
      "text": "These were my people.",
      "startMs": "125120",
      "endMs": "129600",
      "startTimeText": "2:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turns out it didn't work in the box",
      "startMs": "128080",
      "endMs": "132760",
      "startTimeText": "2:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "office. Instead I had",
      "startMs": "129600",
      "endMs": "134920",
      "startTimeText": "2:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "major parts in five or six plays that we",
      "startMs": "132760",
      "endMs": "136720",
      "startTimeText": "2:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "put on that year.",
      "startMs": "134920",
      "endMs": "141600",
      "startTimeText": "2:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "I began to find myself on stage",
      "startMs": "136720",
      "endMs": "145680",
      "startTimeText": "2:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "pretending to be someone else.",
      "startMs": "141600",
      "endMs": "149120",
      "startTimeText": "2:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "I had always seen myself as shy",
      "startMs": "145680",
      "endMs": "152120",
      "startTimeText": "2:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "but hiding in character and costume and",
      "startMs": "149120",
      "endMs": "153640",
      "startTimeText": "2:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "makeup",
      "startMs": "152120",
      "endMs": "155680",
      "startTimeText": "2:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "I had a freedom",
      "startMs": "153640",
      "endMs": "157440",
      "startTimeText": "2:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "a bravery",
      "startMs": "155680",
      "endMs": "160000",
      "startTimeText": "2:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "I had never felt before",
      "startMs": "157440",
      "endMs": "163096",
      "startTimeText": "2:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "and I got an A.",
      "startMs": "160000",
      "endMs": "165116",
      "startTimeText": "2:40"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "163096",
      "endMs": "165116",
      "startTimeText": "2:43"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I was, I realized",
      "startMs": "166600",
      "endMs": "171880",
      "startTimeText": "2:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "present",
      "startMs": "170400",
      "endMs": "175520",
      "startTimeText": "2:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "for possibly the very first time in my",
      "startMs": "171880",
      "endMs": "178360",
      "startTimeText": "2:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "life.",
      "startMs": "175520",
      "endMs": "178360",
      "startTimeText": "2:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "My passion had led me to community.",
      "startMs": "178880",
      "endMs": "185800",
      "startTimeText": "2:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "The head of the theater",
      "startMs": "184239",
      "endMs": "188920",
      "startTimeText": "3:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "department had become a mentor to me.",
      "startMs": "185800",
      "endMs": "191400",
      "startTimeText": "3:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "He invited me to do plays in a summer",
      "startMs": "188920",
      "endMs": "195480",
      "startTimeText": "3:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "theater season he directed. Sure.",
      "startMs": "191400",
      "endMs": "198320",
      "startTimeText": "3:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "And then come to California to join him",
      "startMs": "195480",
      "endMs": "202760",
      "startTimeText": "3:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "again at a more professional theater.",
      "startMs": "198320",
      "endMs": "204680",
      "startTimeText": "3:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow.",
      "startMs": "202760",
      "endMs": "206920",
      "startTimeText": "3:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "Which led to an interview at Columbia",
      "startMs": "204680",
      "endMs": "210160",
      "startTimeText": "3:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pictures which eventually would lead to",
      "startMs": "206920",
      "endMs": "213880",
      "startTimeText": "3:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "my theatrical career.",
      "startMs": "210160",
      "endMs": "213880",
      "startTimeText": "3:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "But",
      "startMs": "214480",
      "endMs": "220040",
      "startTimeText": "3:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "acting was not yet paying the bills.",
      "startMs": "216440",
      "endMs": "222239",
      "startTimeText": "3:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "I was supporting my growing family with",
      "startMs": "220040",
      "endMs": "225440",
      "startTimeText": "3:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "carpentry jobs. Another way to put",
      "startMs": "222239",
      "endMs": "227600",
      "startTimeText": "3:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "food on the table.",
      "startMs": "225440",
      "endMs": "230320",
      "startTimeText": "3:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "I loved making things.",
      "startMs": "227600",
      "endMs": "233440",
      "startTimeText": "3:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "This went on for about",
      "startMs": "230320",
      "endMs": "235920",
      "startTimeText": "3:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I just skipped a line.",
      "startMs": "233440",
      "endMs": "236720",
      "startTimeText": "3:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh",
      "startMs": "235920",
      "endMs": "240680",
      "startTimeText": "3:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "back up for me if you would, please.",
      "startMs": "236720",
      "endMs": "240680",
      "startTimeText": "3:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "And I only took acting jobs when the",
      "startMs": "241200",
      "endMs": "246560",
      "startTimeText": "4:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "part challenged me.",
      "startMs": "243560",
      "endMs": "248400",
      "startTimeText": "4:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "This went on for",
      "startMs": "246560",
      "endMs": "250520",
      "startTimeText": "4:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "about 15 years",
      "startMs": "248400",
      "endMs": "254520",
      "startTimeText": "4:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "during which I did a lot of carpentry",
      "startMs": "250520",
      "endMs": "256959",
      "startTimeText": "4:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "and only four or five acting jobs, but",
      "startMs": "254520",
      "endMs": "261720",
      "startTimeText": "4:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "they were more ambitious, good projects.",
      "startMs": "256959",
      "endMs": "263800",
      "startTimeText": "4:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "And then it all added up",
      "startMs": "261720",
      "endMs": "268280",
      "startTimeText": "4:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "and I got Star Wars.",
      "startMs": "263800",
      "endMs": "268280",
      "startTimeText": "4:23"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "269863",
      "endMs": "271883",
      "startTimeText": "4:29"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> The load lightened. [clears throat]",
      "startMs": "274440",
      "endMs": "277778",
      "startTimeText": "4:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "I had freedom,",
      "startMs": "277800",
      "endMs": "282560",
      "startTimeText": "4:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "opportunity,",
      "startMs": "279720",
      "endMs": "286400",
      "startTimeText": "4:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "but something was still missing.",
      "startMs": "282560",
      "endMs": "286400",
      "startTimeText": "4:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "Passion and purpose",
      "startMs": "286440",
      "endMs": "292560",
      "startTimeText": "4:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "are not the same thing.",
      "startMs": "289520",
      "endMs": "295680",
      "startTimeText": "4:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "Passion brings you joy.",
      "startMs": "292560",
      "endMs": "297280",
      "startTimeText": "4:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "Purpose",
      "startMs": "295680",
      "endMs": "300280",
      "startTimeText": "4:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "brings you meaning.",
      "startMs": "297280",
      "endMs": "301720",
      "startTimeText": "4:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "Passion gets you out of bed in the",
      "startMs": "300280",
      "endMs": "303360",
      "startTimeText": "5:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "morning,",
      "startMs": "301720",
      "endMs": "305840",
      "startTimeText": "5:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "but purpose allows you to sleep at",
      "startMs": "303360",
      "endMs": "307560",
      "startTimeText": "5:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "night.",
      "startMs": "305840",
      "endMs": "310320",
      "startTimeText": "5:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "And I hadn't found purpose higher than",
      "startMs": "307560",
      "endMs": "313320",
      "startTimeText": "5:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "my job yet.",
      "startMs": "310320",
      "endMs": "316600",
      "startTimeText": "5:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "That changed in the late '80s.",
      "startMs": "313320",
      "endMs": "319000",
      "startTimeText": "5:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "I was living in Wyoming",
      "startMs": "316600",
      "endMs": "321040",
      "startTimeText": "5:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "and I was impressed by a group of people",
      "startMs": "319000",
      "endMs": "323520",
      "startTimeText": "5:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "that I met there who had recently formed",
      "startMs": "321040",
      "endMs": "324560",
      "startTimeText": "5:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "a not",
      "startMs": "323520",
      "endMs": "327360",
      "startTimeText": "5:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "a not-for-profit called Conservation",
      "startMs": "324560",
      "endMs": "329520",
      "startTimeText": "5:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "International.",
      "startMs": "327360",
      "endMs": "332200",
      "startTimeText": "5:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "They had inspired leadership",
      "startMs": "329520",
      "endMs": "335480",
      "startTimeText": "5:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "in their founder, Peter Seligmann,",
      "startMs": "332200",
      "endMs": "338640",
      "startTimeText": "5:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "who became a trusted friend.",
      "startMs": "335480",
      "endMs": "341680",
      "startTimeText": "5:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "Their message was simple.",
      "startMs": "338640",
      "endMs": "345600",
      "startTimeText": "5:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nature doesn't need people.",
      "startMs": "341680",
      "endMs": "346720",
      "startTimeText": "5:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "People",
      "startMs": "345600",
      "endMs": "348480",
      "startTimeText": "5:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "need nature",
      "startMs": "346720",
      "endMs": "350428",
      "startTimeText": "5:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "to survive.",
      "startMs": "348480",
      "endMs": "351738",
      "startTimeText": "5:48"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "350428",
      "endMs": "353600",
      "startTimeText": "5:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "[applause]",
      "startMs": "351738",
      "endMs": "356120",
      "startTimeText": "5:51"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> A healthy natural world",
      "startMs": "353600",
      "endMs": "359760",
      "startTimeText": "5:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "provides free services free services to",
      "startMs": "356120",
      "endMs": "363160",
      "startTimeText": "5:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "mankind that we cannot provide for",
      "startMs": "359760",
      "endMs": "364920",
      "startTimeText": "5:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "ourselves.",
      "startMs": "363160",
      "endMs": "367920",
      "startTimeText": "6:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxygen in the air we breathe,",
      "startMs": "364920",
      "endMs": "370800",
      "startTimeText": "6:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "pollinators for our crops,",
      "startMs": "367920",
      "endMs": "373360",
      "startTimeText": "6:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "freshwater and carbon capture from our",
      "startMs": "370800",
      "endMs": "377440",
      "startTimeText": "6:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "forests, wetlands, and ocean,",
      "startMs": "373360",
      "endMs": "380040",
      "startTimeText": "6:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "medicines present and future from the",
      "startMs": "377440",
      "endMs": "382320",
      "startTimeText": "6:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "rainforest.",
      "startMs": "380040",
      "endMs": "386160",
      "startTimeText": "6:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "They had their heads in the sky",
      "startMs": "382320",
      "endMs": "389760",
      "startTimeText": "6:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "and their feet in the mud.",
      "startMs": "386160",
      "endMs": "390760",
      "startTimeText": "6:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "And they",
      "startMs": "389760",
      "endMs": "394120",
      "startTimeText": "6:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "encouraged me to join them.",
      "startMs": "390760",
      "endMs": "396240",
      "startTimeText": "6:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "There it was,",
      "startMs": "394120",
      "endMs": "398480",
      "startTimeText": "6:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "purpose.",
      "startMs": "396240",
      "endMs": "400680",
      "startTimeText": "6:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "A place to put my passion for",
      "startMs": "398480",
      "endMs": "403680",
      "startTimeText": "6:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "storytelling to work.",
      "startMs": "400680",
      "endMs": "405440",
      "startTimeText": "6:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't want to be a poster boy for the",
      "startMs": "403680",
      "endMs": "407160",
      "startTimeText": "6:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "cause. I wanted to be part of the work.",
      "startMs": "405440",
      "endMs": "409919",
      "startTimeText": "6:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "So, I was invited to join the board some",
      "startMs": "407160",
      "endMs": "412240",
      "startTimeText": "6:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "35 years ago.",
      "startMs": "409919",
      "endMs": "414880",
      "startTimeText": "6:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "And that's why I stand here now before",
      "startMs": "412240",
      "endMs": "416440",
      "startTimeText": "6:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "you",
      "startMs": "414880",
      "endMs": "418400",
      "startTimeText": "6:54"
    },
    {
      "text": "to represent",
      "startMs": "416440",
      "endMs": "420560",
      "startTimeText": "6:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "for nature,",
      "startMs": "418400",
      "endMs": "424480",
      "startTimeText": "6:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "the source of life itself.",
      "startMs": "420560",
      "endMs": "424480",
      "startTimeText": "7:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "Humanity is a part of nature,",
      "startMs": "430000",
      "endMs": "437040",
      "startTimeText": "7:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "not above it.",
      "startMs": "434000",
      "endMs": "437040",
      "startTimeText": "7:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "We have an essential mandate to protect",
      "startMs": "437680",
      "endMs": "446200",
      "startTimeText": "7:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "30% of the world's land and sea by 2030",
      "startMs": "441240",
      "endMs": "449560",
      "startTimeText": "7:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "to prevent the mass extinction, to slow",
      "startMs": "446200",
      "endMs": "452240",
      "startTimeText": "7:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "the warming of our planet.",
      "startMs": "449560",
      "endMs": "453880",
      "startTimeText": "7:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "Still,",
      "startMs": "452240",
      "endMs": "458480",
      "startTimeText": "7:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "despite new science, new policies,",
      "startMs": "453880",
      "endMs": "461120",
      "startTimeText": "7:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "we are still losing nature",
      "startMs": "458480",
      "endMs": "462920",
      "startTimeText": "7:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "to profiteering,",
      "startMs": "461120",
      "endMs": "465600",
      "startTimeText": "7:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "corruption, conflict,",
      "startMs": "462920",
      "endMs": "467880",
      "startTimeText": "7:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "including land that is already protected",
      "startMs": "465600",
      "endMs": "471240",
      "startTimeText": "7:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "on paper. These efforts matter,",
      "startMs": "467880",
      "endMs": "473800",
      "startTimeText": "7:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "but they're not enough.",
      "startMs": "471240",
      "endMs": "478155",
      "startTimeText": "7:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "We need cultural change.",
      "startMs": "473800",
      "endMs": "480175",
      "startTimeText": "7:53"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "478155",
      "endMs": "480175",
      "startTimeText": "7:58"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> We need to extend social justice.",
      "startMs": "482160",
      "endMs": "488690",
      "startTimeText": "8:02"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "486670",
      "endMs": "488690",
      "startTimeText": "8:06"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> We need to respect and elevate the",
      "startMs": "488840",
      "endMs": "493480",
      "startTimeText": "8:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "indigenous peoples that are being",
      "startMs": "491320",
      "endMs": "497240",
      "startTimeText": "8:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "marginalized, and in many cases killed",
      "startMs": "493480",
      "endMs": "500560",
      "startTimeText": "8:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "in cold blood.",
      "startMs": "497240",
      "endMs": "500560",
      "startTimeText": "8:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "These communities have long understood",
      "startMs": "502240",
      "endMs": "508080",
      "startTimeText": "8:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "that the trees,",
      "startMs": "506320",
      "endMs": "509680",
      "startTimeText": "8:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "the mountain,",
      "startMs": "508080",
      "endMs": "512680",
      "startTimeText": "8:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "water, soil",
      "startMs": "509680",
      "endMs": "515360",
      "startTimeText": "8:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "are not commodities.",
      "startMs": "512680",
      "endMs": "517360",
      "startTimeText": "8:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "They are relatives",
      "startMs": "515360",
      "endMs": "520120",
      "startTimeText": "8:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "to be cherished for following",
      "startMs": "517360",
      "endMs": "524660",
      "startTimeText": "8:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "generations to embrace and protect.",
      "startMs": "520120",
      "endMs": "526681",
      "startTimeText": "8:40"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "524660",
      "endMs": "526681",
      "startTimeText": "8:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "[applause]",
      "startMs": "528591",
      "endMs": "532920",
      "startTimeText": "8:48"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> We can all play a role by embracing that",
      "startMs": "529480",
      "endMs": "537360",
      "startTimeText": "8:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "wisdom in our day-to-day lives.",
      "startMs": "532920",
      "endMs": "540240",
      "startTimeText": "8:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "By loving the planet,",
      "startMs": "537360",
      "endMs": "544160",
      "startTimeText": "8:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "by honoring nature's authority,",
      "startMs": "540240",
      "endMs": "546120",
      "startTimeText": "9:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "her generosity,",
      "startMs": "544160",
      "endMs": "548600",
      "startTimeText": "9:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "the bounty she affords us,",
      "startMs": "546120",
      "endMs": "551960",
      "startTimeText": "9:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "the justice of her example.",
      "startMs": "548600",
      "endMs": "555240",
      "startTimeText": "9:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the world you're stepping into,",
      "startMs": "551960",
      "endMs": "558480",
      "startTimeText": "9:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "the world my generation left you,",
      "startMs": "555240",
      "endMs": "561800",
      "startTimeText": "9:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "is a real mess.",
      "startMs": "558480",
      "endMs": "561800",
      "startTimeText": "9:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "Saving nature isn't our only job.",
      "startMs": "564200",
      "endMs": "570360",
      "startTimeText": "9:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "There are opportunities to be embraced",
      "startMs": "568280",
      "endMs": "572720",
      "startTimeText": "9:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "in society and business,",
      "startMs": "570360",
      "endMs": "576000",
      "startTimeText": "9:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "in the kind of lives we live.",
      "startMs": "572720",
      "endMs": "579280",
      "startTimeText": "9:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "So, find a place for yourself.",
      "startMs": "576000",
      "endMs": "582600",
      "startTimeText": "9:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever talent or ambition you have,",
      "startMs": "579280",
      "endMs": "586160",
      "startTimeText": "9:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "find some way to put it to work.",
      "startMs": "582600",
      "endMs": "588560",
      "startTimeText": "9:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "Build something that didn't exist",
      "startMs": "586160",
      "endMs": "590200",
      "startTimeText": "9:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "yesterday.",
      "startMs": "588560",
      "endMs": "592400",
      "startTimeText": "9:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stand up for someone who can't stand up",
      "startMs": "590200",
      "endMs": "594680",
      "startTimeText": "9:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "for themselves.",
      "startMs": "592400",
      "endMs": "596920",
      "startTimeText": "9:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring people together who weren't",
      "startMs": "594680",
      "endMs": "599480",
      "startTimeText": "9:54"
    },
    {
      "text": "talking before.",
      "startMs": "596920",
      "endMs": "601400",
      "startTimeText": "9:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "That's leadership.",
      "startMs": "599480",
      "endMs": "604200",
      "startTimeText": "9:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "That's what moves the needle.",
      "startMs": "601400",
      "endMs": "607480",
      "startTimeText": "10:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your generation",
      "startMs": "604200",
      "endMs": "607480",
      "startTimeText": "10:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "has far more power than you may realize.",
      "startMs": "607520",
      "endMs": "613920",
      "startTimeText": "10:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "And if you harness that power,",
      "startMs": "611440",
      "endMs": "616440",
      "startTimeText": "10:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "if you find your leadership, your",
      "startMs": "613920",
      "endMs": "619440",
      "startTimeText": "10:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "issues, your voice,",
      "startMs": "616440",
      "endMs": "622400",
      "startTimeText": "10:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "the world will not be able to ignore",
      "startMs": "619440",
      "endMs": "623320",
      "startTimeText": "10:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "you.",
      "startMs": "622400",
      "endMs": "626840",
      "startTimeText": "10:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "You will have to be accommodated.",
      "startMs": "623320",
      "endMs": "628520",
      "startTimeText": "10:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "Believe me,",
      "startMs": "626840",
      "endMs": "631360",
      "startTimeText": "10:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "I know that's true.",
      "startMs": "628520",
      "endMs": "633400",
      "startTimeText": "10:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't wait.",
      "startMs": "631360",
      "endMs": "637440",
      "startTimeText": "10:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "When opportunity presents, recognize it.",
      "startMs": "633400",
      "endMs": "639520",
      "startTimeText": "10:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is your time.",
      "startMs": "637440",
      "endMs": "640880",
      "startTimeText": "10:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "Own it.",
      "startMs": "639520",
      "endMs": "644000",
      "startTimeText": "10:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy every second of it.",
      "startMs": "640880",
      "endMs": "645240",
      "startTimeText": "10:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because",
      "startMs": "644000",
      "endMs": "647080",
      "startTimeText": "10:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "what could be worse than getting to the",
      "startMs": "645240",
      "endMs": "649360",
      "startTimeText": "10:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "end of your life and realizing that you",
      "startMs": "647080",
      "endMs": "652880",
      "startTimeText": "10:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "haven't fully lived it?",
      "startMs": "649360",
      "endMs": "655880",
      "startTimeText": "10:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "Congratulations.",
      "startMs": "652880",
      "endMs": "655880",
      "startTimeText": "10:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "Go change the world.",
      "startMs": "657560",
      "endMs": "660902",
      "startTimeText": "10:57"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "660247",
      "endMs": "662922",
      "startTimeText": "11:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "[applause]",
      "startMs": "660902",
      "endMs": "662922",
      "startTimeText": "11:00"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Access over 1,000 resources to [music]",
      "startMs": "663320",
      "endMs": "667640",
      "startTimeText": "11:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "improve your English faster.",
      "startMs": "665520",
      "endMs": "671280",
      "startTimeText": "11:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything's in one place.",
      "startMs": "667640",
      "endMs": "671280",
      "startTimeText": "11:07"
    }
  ],
